[00:13.24]1. This is a song, a happy song of vict’ry;
[00:18.74]It magnifies the One who is supreme.
[00:24.38]The words give hope and prompt all to be loyal.
[00:29.98]Come sing with us; enjoy its Kingdom theme:
[00:32.18](Chorus)
[00:34.38]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[00:40.80]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[00:46.56]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[00:51.64]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
[01:08.64]2. With this new song, we advertise the Kingdom.
[01:13.96]Christ Jesus rules; the earth is his domain.
[01:19.84]And as foretold, there is a newborn nation:
[01:25.04]The Kingdom heirs, who welcome Jesus’ reign:
[01:27.24](Chorus)
[01:29.44]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[01:36.00]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[01:41.64]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[01:47.12]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’
[02:12.00]3. This Kingdom song, all humble ones can master.
[02:17.50]The words are clear, their message warm and bright.
[02:22.94]In all the earth, a multitude have learned it,
[02:30.46]And they in turn still others now invite:
[02:34.52](Chorus)
[02:38.58]‘Come worship God Before his throne.
[02:42.64]His Son is King; Let’s make it known!
[02:46.64]Come learn this song, this song about the Kingdom;
[02:52.64]Bow down to God, and praise his holy name.’